---

This product has no third-party dependencies. The reference implementation
uses only the Python standard library, and no third-party source is vendored
into this repository.

Demo data in fixtures/ is entirely invented. Book metadata fetched at runtime
comes from the Open Library API (openlibrary.org) and is not redistributed
here; cover images are referenced by URL and never copied into this repository.
